'''Rupture''' is a stackable [[debuff]] that causes the affected target to take more damage from [[bleeding]], but also causes bleeding on the affected target to [[expire]] 25% more quickly. Up to 4 Ruptures can be active on a target. Each stack has a 3 second duration. 
[[File:rupturevisual.png|thumb|A Ruptured Gladiator Statue appears bloodsoaked. Also shown: minor blood spray near neck due to non-aggravated Bleeding.]]

==Mechanics==
Rupture is a dynamic debuff: an enemy starts taking more damage from all their bleeds when they become Ruptured, and cease to do so when Rupture expires. Similarly, an enemy that becomes Ruptured will have the timers on their bleeding debuffs speed up, and return to normal speed if Rupture is removed.

Unlike {{c|mod|Bleeding you inflict deals Damage #% faster}}, Rupture does not affect the base DPS and base duration values of bleeding debuffs. Due to applying to different things at different times, the overall effect on damage dealt is effectively multiplicative.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3123794</ref>  

The only current source of Rupture is {{il|Rupture Support}}, which sets the debuff's values based on its gem level. The default values when Rupture was available from a global stat were 25% and 25%. 

